  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2317f2bed09065d36d771c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖我就要捣蛋喔～\r\n呵呵呵，我很擅长\r\n跟别人要糖果喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae3c8fb353042c12c7e898aec58cd3bee4f47e7142153cd17ef37ef96e9b93a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3a61a74fce45880eb552a44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候我很擅长\r\n等待圣诞老人喔。\r\n晚上我也都能立刻入睡～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0694431317bd8a626042954703cb094241e8b6393cec28f53bffc4b179e21d40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:516b66a6611dbcaa053e46c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得，无论是忙碌热闹的圣诞节\r\n还是悠哉安静的圣诞节都好，\r\n只要跟你在一起就会很开心～",
      "source_fingerprint": "42abc38c1927ad1b476a852cfff94b91d65be1d717552e9aee1aa10e80f48edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4acbf52cce89895d46e8ff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我成功了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "129c0c73b8ca07acc055f8705289f86f7289c05310cbbb624c89eea122fdc5c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c203c3f1a4d7baf8ec11178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说年底很忙碌，但我想\r\n此时更该找时间悠闲地散步。\r\n要不要一起去啊～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb01b915ce44556c3502b0c22a5c549b13d03342b61e5a4f7aefd27a55f1a8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488e9da111fafc3a3d08752c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n今天就一起……\r\n睡睡午觉～晒晒太阳吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3822a582ff57c2bf430386f9bafea7a9e63183a032cf1befd4a412139009fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e4369cd79e76541ba5cd10d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我送的生日礼物是\r\n跟我的衣服同品牌的\r\n荷叶边衬衫喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c42c655b247f4514ac8f54a6d05f184985543565da001cc60905a350a003e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0f2668df5ba0e2868d8f5cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年赖恩姐姐都会\r\n抢先第一个祝我生日快乐。\r\n呵呵呵～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd1c337951b07bae9f091a9156f7c9c9189275f48164d404aaf3db488ac1b0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02338698fe58d53c2f7ef303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝福。\r\n虽然步调缓慢，\r\n但我会扎实稳健地持续成长的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2797e153495b86d232598aefa8aeaf9879b48f4c4855d06a1138a023376e4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6109ee2c487b9f4b63345d11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到公告了喔～\r\n没问题的，应该才刚收到，\r\n还是新的……应该吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77c8ed8e85a1f8663e634b84a15998a7d222bb48b5f3711451ef53136c794a73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ab0cbce37d578331ea2ccc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了喔～\r\n希望里面是令人开心的礼物呢，\r\n例如洋娃娃啊、缎带之类的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6cd4ba83c528b728bf164add944318d952ca2e22c3faff81a63741e30db2c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ec3973b091c131470182f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\r\n你已经达成任务了～？\r\n恭喜你～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ddedf4674f3f4bd1a821627b6b1fe7d184818e28a56794ba02802d80187a8c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b33710b14ce2e3a210be830c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说即将要举办活动了呢～\r\n得多加注意，\r\n别不小心错过了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1332c26d032c919e3ab92bce02745a83475d8098ab0187d2e774f729ffa5ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d3427bf58399d946ce4d76b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\r\n现在正在举办活动呢～\r\n要不要去试试看呀～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ce5d140fff3a861ff3cda274f846c572f8e7aa7e46a6f7e0bf9a2bb1c25283",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:668cfaeffc7be27477e2a0c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次还有机会～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61889f5573eafb7aa310d75cf908350ad92bca1472abfd3fcf4a13a2912c847c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbca4eaaa94c75a881be02db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴的等级好像提升了～\r\n要去确认看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18ba2b9054ef5fae2d7cd8e105e06feb9cec239c630362a172f965690321c4fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b959a6b80126c4339e656d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミントカラーと大きなフリルを見て\r\n一目ぼれしたお洋服なのです。\r\n可憐で、清楚。メジロのようで～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3b6d9aaaa468fab9109ce468827de69ad4ed009f48f4797052798bb65da188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbda95afcca7eeb6cdbce972",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔はライアンお姉さまとドーベルが\r\n片方ずつ三つ編みをしてくれ\r\nましたの。幸せも2倍でしたわ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d1d729a69d42dbafa0767ecd36973d16bbf278bc998da3376b41ae2ded24811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3984060899ec14db9f47dec9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海外のドール作家さんとやりとりを\r\nしたくて、外国語のお勉強をして\r\nおりますの。ぼんじゅーる、ですわ",
      "source_fingerprint": "77605a0221a97bddca905e311603064addd82eb7e4a898f9d375ae1671dedada",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f11b629ddb5309b43ad4de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很努力了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d59e5f703d5f47d55b2943b95306ec6ad674a360dca121cc7d2764088c8667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeaba524c0a2faf7b7296330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位都表现得很棒～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c92c146afecdda4b77410b0963edd4430452d6d6de4d1e0bab833e2a85e62dc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7f83e867fd653d891c0c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次还有机会～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61889f5573eafb7aa310d75cf908350ad92bca1472abfd3fcf4a13a2912c847c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa95ec74a47ad9d32c10a17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很努力了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d59e5f703d5f47d55b2943b95306ec6ad674a360dca121cc7d2764088c8667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
