      "source_text": "好可爱……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c6f7fc9e21a092abce9fd17eb7328cd5c18366c827dd330804162c6654d7f36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a98bcfa7edbbaff20c25a39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是美妙呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eaedb5511958a8ac05964981cf4dd5c20e90720cdf9e1a5e2df9d912a2582f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:576ce5b121149988669d3440",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8a3096875a7dc77cda646ff87c9c22eca06f70f59a036288e698b17b9b7c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f21b7aa1e08d810d1dbfbdbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6d8458e0d0c283a28cdf0b2904ed93a7dfbc7b68b667ed9ee61b5a7aaf69e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a2381df1192267f00869995",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兴奋期待……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad9c718fe215c618a31ce98b23e1181f1f8ae7730ae98399b1814a49ad4aede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f91524be334b1d6728df4ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢慢来就好了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b15b1c349bfe17d8ae12de4819f3df71e9cb7f75837bf819d81d2a11e4e2773",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:031b9241d024fe9388f5ad76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc5deab641f8307a14ea04e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d84935b18b0970e02c53c3b0ce361bf67c5155f379d3c2a7f32b24da4815e0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf2c483e080aaf8daa02995",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天将会\r\n收到这些喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eff5c8586ef70006ba8d5bf32e19a09ac8a6d6f5291365c16d8677e6a221b73c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0414c18bb3ec760436b6eaf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么好像……\r\n自己的动作比平时更加缓慢……\r\n总有这种感觉～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b5a63dbf76e0f97e8ae7f1e0f276c00b87cbb8582ad23edac0a7994af3e7b55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28fa07b1b3248b3e5be3ab22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……总觉得今天好像\r\n比平时再～更轻松悠闲点\r\n会比较好呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "033591f10bd89db1675032fb7b4c4c44646e43c724c07aa39ea3e68ac9f67278",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:978a1c5ce857c22fcc0802e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵。\r\n我状况绝佳，心情也非常好。\r\n来吧，要开跑啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "444ab9745e34c9e2b18083b97e9dd570b0cf3c20353b8899302354a49a82d10a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb5360bc984caa512188ba51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心里与身体都在吶喊着快跑啊……\r\n虽然我认为焦急不好，\r\n但我也不打算错过良机喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d0f3ad98febc850c53e431b0f459a8b243c868c048840ab4208614e19fe8cc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eafa7c26537af9944da9816",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充分享受悠哉的时光后，\r\n我现在感觉精神奕奕。\r\n随时都可以开始喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "11ba0591f8848d1b816a48060a1c64d40ab7ea59d18141d0fdf1d055ff867814",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a541e566ffcc814d79861970",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要用尽全力好好加油喔。\r\n训练员，来吧，跟我一起喊，\r\n加油～加油～喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef781186dda5f4e0ecf161b43eecf84b65dd2bf79580078b0fd0da68a6eaca94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0819795f50ac1d3b7a65afef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\r\n原来训练时间已经到了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cda576c312a55b214f0ccb3c97818efb8bf7923205e5e565dc73574b1471c548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fefaadd8b2674fa241a3f22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天打算做些什么项目呢～？\r\n没关系，你可以慢慢决定。\r\n毕竟我很擅长等待嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "34154e36c7dba8885bf05b8040e9a88cb761c627fcf721370aaf5fc1001f5251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53c154c3011baebda2cc3d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……\r\n天气如此舒适，\r\n令人不禁想睡午觉呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c199fa444d28f7ba7086a65e25abe9bd1d50a7a6182ed54a912db757c51355a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81f601990c963f853de5946",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得身体有些沉重……\r\n没关系，我觉得\r\n应该不会妨碍训练的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbdb4c7401a113d967d6e4afad38eb00eafb0a9b1169a0848fed9e4d4133058b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2048716e0cd7b8ea0cb9fb1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼噜……呼噜……咦？\r\n哎呀，不好了。\r\n我不小心睡着了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2230cffbfe755ebc9ff36a85e7e49ab0597d13319feb55d25445e4734b7d5a2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd000edbb95f80b4498f2e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我该怎么做才好……\r\n该怎么做才能追上……不，\r\n我失言了。请忘掉刚刚那句话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a2c4dd0c1ec2c347a417c80893825b72bc969e39d5c96f65c2b23171c1345f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27aabf16a9932c91ec0caa09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，又要参赛了呀～\r\n我不太习惯这么忙碌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d44cf0a29e1b306ef2849fdab7a16620668afd46308bf23a391618ce48cb3aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfbcb6d076753bacfbf8a21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我想绽放光芒。\r\n正因为这样，所以此刻\r\n是否忍耐得住也是至关重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cab4f608805104eb377740e621a25f18f59ac03f7bbb025b9b8b3e49cfa65164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f2231f3be2e93aa53d1775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请在优胜者区域\r\n等我回来喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "652a6e9841ec269a38fc0b94da6d915f2073457e49d6f8138301fd458e83356b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41ac675340f1d28ffce22d86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要让众人见识。\r\n目白家的威望……\r\n还有属于我的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e1f834dea8db4344914e967194ba4c6577d1da514d79bcd0b93ddcf405e793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2635862927181a3d5de4fad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在非常冷静。\r\n但内心深处却非常炙热～我听得到\r\n有个声音对我说「一定要赢」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ff9851ba6d407866de1644cae52047f226a952810d1fd9f75690bcdbd3d17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6202d0b561c522939ccd588",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我相信……春天一定\r\n会来临，花朵一定能盛开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58cdb4a87f82fd585e683151a0623fb76d7e0995b329f5600879d5c55e4224cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50fc23347dc19bce6f6270d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说我天生个性悠哉，\r\n却也难以抵抗这股激昂感。\r\n我出发啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed293c05e6f776c310654046c313a47305d37c9ffee69bdfa5c676e27e2f4a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ce6a3278a407bac8c4d4d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了在那里绽放光芒……\r\n我会好好加油的，\r\n训练员～",
      "source_fingerprint": "be45757c0bbd1ae0a4d3c491fddae202486fabfa7107eb571009cde117ed6edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b5c56ebc1cad3d1b7cbba8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我丝毫不觉得紧张喔。\r\n不过我可是有\r\n必胜的决心喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b99ef6548ebfc8ef6a7f764e2689e7817bae7535c4fadc88cbe42d2d7f623132",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22877169b6991920752cfd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，\r\n已经轮到我上场了啊～？\r\n我会全力以赴的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7ee5e174a11d44568a860dce7c1d3c24d9e659904002569d4892f0853803f52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1e9808b0de7e5aeb66d5180",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟比赛期间中……我仍坚持\r\n以自己的步调～\r\n进行了大量练习呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b93d2db32252f41e2dd4177585964d99faf9a34db7401e395def95b3acc3ebb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e49cd9cc08280eccfeb85ae5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不值得自豪，\r\n但我的脸皮还挺厚的喔。\r\n这点小事根本不算什么～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0616cebdb445607fb2a36d60546ed8b72c9a6f92e31ce4d329783b43dee4b8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c84d226dd08d622fcef787d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以说丧气话喔。\r\n要是为了自己的言语而情绪低落，\r\n可是会输掉原本能赢的比赛喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d881969a975d33c9d3b2bdd671385663c18f0bce5aa62678024c9bbedcdf693",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5545e9f092a2ffe7b413f80f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走进闸门后等着我的就只剩开跑了。\r\n我会全神贯注在奔跑上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7f97d93e38468297101de613e4a88840070472c26d646f31878df4155b8b73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20034"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
